## P2: Mobile + Touch UX Overhaul

### P2.1 Overlay menu system across all form factors
- Source: Item 2
- Requirement:
	- Replace side-panels with overlay/drawer patterns for desktop and mobile.
	- Use consistent open/close interactions and focus management.
- Why later: Important usability improvement, but not platform blocker.
- Dependencies: P1 IA decisions recommended first
- Done when:
	- No primary workflow depends on fixed side-panels.
	- Overlay navigation is keyboard and touch accessible.

### P2.2 Touchscreen-friendly interaction pass
- Source: Item 3
- Requirement:
	- Increase touch target sizes.
	- Ensure spacing, scroll behavior, and gestures are touch-usable.
	- Validate core flows on mobile and tablet.
- Why later: UX optimization after functional correctness.
- Dependencies: P2.1
- Done when:
	- Core flows pass touch usability checks (login, admin nav, create user, create workspace).

